# Density Compare
# Aluminium (Al) — real density 2.7 g/cm³. equal masses: Aluminium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Aluminium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 14.3mm material: aluminum at (-20mm, 7.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 21.5 g — the water cube is the reference
